	I downloaded the NetHack binary for the PC last week.  As an
old fan of Hack, I was pleased to find NetHack.  In the endgame,
however, when the top "n" scores, mine, the ones around me, etc. are
supposed to list, it merely lists ALL scores, apparently not paying
attention to the OPTIONS line specifying how I want the list.  Is this
a known feature/bug?  I thought I'd check before writing to the
bug-report address.  Also, it occasionally locks up upon exit from the
endgame.  Does anyone else see this behavior?

